// Owner: WP5 — DESIGN_SPEC §5.5 / §6.5 layer 1: the plate as a long exposure.
// Light on a dark photographic plate: silver line-screen light for diffusion (3 angles), ember light for
// shortcut walkers (2 angles), a mip-sum glow (levels 1–4 of the density texture, B-spline filtered, no FBO)
// mapped through the OKLab-built silver / ember ramps, a gold arrival flash that exposes the plate around the
// target, a pointer lamp (finer hatch, +15 %), animated film grain at half rate, a filmic 1 − exp(−k·E)
// response, a soft shoulder and a dithered sRGB encode (no banding in the dark gradients).
//
// The JS side prepends, right after the #version line:
//   #define GLOW_LEVELS 0|2|4     (tier.glow)
